  "description": "A simple and efficient implementation of a Circular Buffer (also known as a Ring Buffer) for .NET.\n      This data structure is ideal for managing fixed-size data collections, such as logs, streaming data,\n      sensor readings, or task queues. Supports thread-safe operations, automatic overwriting of old data,\n      and provides utility methods like ToArray, Peek, and TryDequeue.",
